Introduction to Kafka
=====================

General
-------
The Introduction to Apache Kafka training course will provide the path for how to develop a scalable and robust messaging implementation with Kafka, a distributed, partitioned, replicated commit log service.

Intended Audience
-----------------
* This class is targeted at developers and those who would be implementing producers and consumers in a kafka topology.

Duration
--------
16 hours / 2 days

Prerequisits
------------
* Prior experience with java required.

Objectives
----------
* Learn the fundamentals of Kafka
* Gain understanding on how Kafka fits into the Hadoop ecosystem as well as the enterprise
* Build consumers and producers and integrate with other ecosystem products
* Make Kafka scale

Outline
-------
* Overview
	* Use Cases
	* Ecosystem
* Producer API
* Consumer API
	* High Level
	* Simple
* Configuration
	* Broker
	* Consumer
	* Producer
	* New Producer
* Design Points
	* Persistence
	* Producer
	* Consumer
	* Message Delivery
	* Replication
	* Log Compaction
